 title=\"73-thm-cfg-fixed-point-correctness\">73-thm-cfg-fixed-point-correctness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§7.1, print pp. 261–275; PDF pp. 283–297; local effective construction"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorem 4.3, pp. 90–91; scans 98–99"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"7"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EpsFree}\">\\(\\operatorname{EpsFree}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3b0149ed221ad66a\" href=\"?note=3b0149ed221ad66a\" title=\"73-df-cfg-epsilon-elimination\">73-df-cfg-epsilon-elimination</a>，可空语义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a01cd76e5cbb0051\" href=\"?note=a01cd76e5cbb0051\" title=\"73-thm-cfg-fixed-point-correctness\">73-thm-cfg-fixed-point-correctness</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}elimination\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EpsFree}(G)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\land L(\\operatorname{EpsFree}(G))=L(G)\\setminus\\{\\varepsilon\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}elimination\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EpsFree}(G)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\land L(\\operatorname{EpsFree}(G))=L(G)\\setminus\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>把原完整推导树中产出为空的子树剪去，剩余产生式属于 P⁻，得到正向。反向给每个被删除位置嫁接一个可空推导树。每个原右部只有有限个子序列，所以 P⁻ 有限。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-epsilon-elimination","status":"resolved","id":"3b0149ed221ad66a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-epsilon-elimination]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-cfg-fixed-point-correctness","status":"resolved","id":"a01cd76e5cbb0051","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-cfg-fixed-point-correctness]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-epsilon-elimination","status":"resolved","id":"3b0149ed221ad66a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$；$\\operatorname{EpsFree}$ 见 [[73-df-cfg-epsilon-elimination]]，可空语义见 [[73-thm-cfg-fixed-point-correctness]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-cfg-fixed-point-correctness","status":"resolved","id":"a01cd76e5cbb0051","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$；$\\operatorname{EpsFree}$ 见 [[73-df-cfg-epsilon-elimination]]，可空语义见 [[73-thm-cfg-fixed-point-correctness]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EpsFree}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}elimination\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EpsFree}(G)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\land L(\\operatorname{EpsFree}(G))=L(G)\\setminus\\{\\varepsilon\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1648,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","ancho